# with more admissions" would silently re-point the study every time a walk got further,
# and the reason a frame is canonical is not its size.
#
# Set 2026-08-19 by the operator's instruction, after the measurement below.

vantage:  ru-mobile
frame:    ref/ru-frame-stageB-ru-mobile-2026-08-19.tsv
ledger:   public-data/frame-stageb-ru-mobile-2026-08-19-schema3.jsonl

# WHY, measured rather than assumed (tools/adint-frame-compare, ranks 13–2463, 102 domains
# reached by both walks):
#
#   HOLE in an nl-direct-built frame — ru-mobile admits these, nl-direct does not:
#     #1163  rbc.ru        nl-direct says blocked (401)
#     #1169  gismeteo.ru   nl-direct says blocked (403)
#     #1754  hh.ru         nl-direct says ya-generic-only  <- NOT an access failure
#   HOLE in a ru-mobile-built frame (found 07:44Z, ~15 min after this file was written):
#     #3128  lenta.ru      ru-mobile says ad-serving-only
#
# THAT SECOND HOLE CORRECTS THIS FILE'S ORIGINAL ARGUMENT. When the declaration was made the
# asymmetry was one-directional and the RU frame lost nothing; the RU walk then reached rank
# 3128 and it no longer is. NEITHER single-vantage frame is complete: hh.ru is admitted only
# from Moscow, lenta.ru only from Amsterdam, and both are CONTENT differences rather than
# access. The union (11 domains at ranks 13-3128) is strictly better than either.
#
# The declaration is left at `ru-mobile` because that is the operator's instruction and it
# is still the smaller hole — 1 against 3. Switching to a union frame is a decision for the
# operator, not for whoever regenerates this file, and it carries a real cost: a union is no
# longer a rank-ordered prefix of ONE walk, so its reproduction instructions change.
#
# lenta.ru is not a flake and not a config change, and the evidence is the INTERLEAVING:
#   07:10:42Z  nl-direct  admit            hb_present=True   settle 8s
#   07:36:23Z  ru-mobile  ad-serving-only  hb_present=False  settle 45s
#   07:38:47Z  nl-direct  admit            hb_present=True   settle 45s   <- between the two
#   07:42:45Z  ru-mobile  ad-serving-only  hb_present=False  settle 45s
# An NL read sits BETWEEN two RU reads, and both re-probes used the same window. Time cannot
# explain it and neither can the window; the vantage can. (Interleave the probes whenever a
# per-vantage difference has to be told apart from a per-time one.)
#
# The asymmetry is the whole argument. A frame built from Amsterdam is a frame of "Russian
# sites Amsterdam is allowed to load", and it never says so; two of its three holes are
# outright refusals and the third is worse — hh.ru is not blocked from Amsterdam, it serves
# a DIFFERENT PAGE there, one carrying only the generic Yandex namespace and no auction
# config. So vantage-dependence is not only access. A page you can load can still be the
# wrong page.
#
# PENDING, and it is progress rather than a defect: lenta.ru #3128 and iz.ru #3322 are
# admitted by the deeper nl-direct walk and the ru-mobile walk has not reached them yet.
# They are NOT added by hand — the frame is a rank-ordered PREFIX of the universe, and
# admitting a domain out of order would destroy the one property that makes the frame
# reproducible by a stranger. They enter when the walk arrives.
